   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "steps 3\u20135: one warehouse transaction per table, so a failure rolls back only that table\nevery ETL_INTERVAL_S = 60 s, and on POST /v1/runs (X-Admin-Key)\nevery 10 runs: reconcile, rows gone from a source \u2192 is_deleted = true\none run at a time (advisory lock) \u00b7 a source that is down fails only its tables\nGET /health \u00b7 GET /metrics",
   "originalText": "steps 3\u20135: one warehouse transaction per table, so a failure rolls back only that table\nevery ETL_INTERVAL_S = 60 s, and on POST /v1/runs (X-Admin-Key)\nevery 10 runs: reconcile, rows gone from a source \u2192 is_deleted = true\none run at a time (advisory lock) \u00b7 a source that is down fails only its tables\nGET /health \u00b7 GET /metrics",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
